<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> The Foundation discovered this space manipulating anomaly at the edges of the Solar System while Voyager was passing through the Oort Cloud. Voyager captured an image of it believing it was a distant star and sent it to NASA’s JPL. An agent infiltrated there has confiscated the image and brought it to the SCP Foundation. It has been suggested that this abnormality is a sentient space phenomenon that needs to feed to survive. It appears to remain mostly still in its region.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The exploration of the interior of the SCP that has revealed dangerous entities inside.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> This anomaly is not particularly dangerous, the real danger is the entities located inside of it. Exploration of the SCP has revealed what appeared to be sentient shadows that inhabit the other side of the oddity. The shadows are almost uncontainable, their only known weakness being high levels of light.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This is my first SCP, I'm new here. Please tell me what you think.<br />
Note: I also made a sandbox page about this SCP if you want to see it. Thanks ;)</p>

