<p>Hey Aaris! Im not able to give greenlights but i do wanna review your concept:</p>
<p>So I feel like the information you have given at the moment is pretty low, with not much information about well&#8230; anything. Like you dont explain how the SCP originated, or what it does or why the foundation would try to contain it.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>It is very powerful and capable of causing an XK End-of-the-world-event</p>
</blockquote>
<p>What makes the anomaly powerful? How can it cause an XK class end of the world scenario? is there any more to it or does it just work like a bridge to another place?</p>
<p>At the moment I feel like the anomaly isnt explained well enough for the reader to care, like it proposes an interesting concept but apart from that it kinda just sits around.</p>
<p>Sorry if im being a little harsh I just feel like this idea has some potential and could become really good if its more fleshed out. Considering this is your first SCP I feel like looking around the site for similar SCP's could help flesh out your idea.</p>
<p>You should take a look at this list and read some of the portal related articles, It could help you with your idea: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/portal">http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/portal</a></p>
<p>You should also contact a member of the butterfly sqaud as they have more experience than me and can give you better tips.</p>

