			<div class="content" id="post-content-4734235">
									

<p>Hey, I checked your draft and after reading it completely, these are some of the things I noticed:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>No man-made objects or beings are to interfere or to approach SCP-5516 closer than 3&#160;km of the event horizon. If the anomaly ever enters the Solar System closer than Pluto, it could cause devastating consequences such as disrupting the current orbits of the planets, crashing a planet into another, or completely destroying a planet by ripping it apart into atoms and/or transporting it to an unknown location.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I noticed some redaction mistakes in this part, for example: approach SCP closer than 3km of the evnt horizon. This could be instead written as: No man made objects or living organisms are to interfere or approach SCP-XXXX in a range of 3km from the event horizon. Also, I feel that the second part, the one that references the SCP passing Pluto would go in the description, however noting as your SCP is so powerful, you could instead put a protocol which must be followed in case of that event.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>Dr. [DATA EXPUNCT]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>First of all, its written data expunged and also, Data expunged is used to cover really violent or secret thing in an article, if you wish to keep the doctor's name a secret, you could instead use this: Dr. ████, to put the black boxes simply type Alt+219</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The origins of the wormhole is unknown, but some theorized that it was created by the same beings that created SCP-2399</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Another strangely written frase, you could instead write something like this: Explanations regarding the origin of SCP-XXXX are currently unknown, although foundation astronomers and astrophysicist believe it may have been created by the same beings who created SCP-2399 in an attempt at transporting the ship.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Our satellites will monitor SCP-5516 for any objects that exit its event horizon for any extra-dimensional or extraterrestrial threats.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This part should go on the containment procedures an should be written more formally, remember, this is a document. Something like this could work: Foundation satellites are to monitor any objects that exit SCP-XXXX.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The anomaly was first observed in 2016, while Voyager travelled through the Oort Cloud at 31&#160;km from its event horizon. Voyager captured an image of the anomaly and sent it to NASA headquarters who immediately called for SCP agents to investigate.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Well this part is kinda weird. to my knowledge, NASA does not have any asociation to the SCP foundation so the fact that NASA calls the foundation to investigate this is weird. If im not mistaken the foundation actually had to cover up SCP's like SCP-139 from NASA and other astronomers. Maybe NASA did find the wormhole, however the pictures were quicly confiscated by the foundation without NASA having any real knowledge as to why.</p>
<p>Overall for it being your first SCP its not that bad. You should correct some spelling mistakes and contact someone from the butterfly squad so that they can also help you with this project. Good luck!</p>
</div>
