<p>I'm not exactly clear on what the series of events here is beyond the discovery and the explorations? That feels like a lot of setup, but there's very little payoff here, nevermind an ending. You've set up half a narrative arc, but haven't really finished it, or at least described the ending to it here. I'd really need that detail to be confident in this idea.</p>
