			<div class="content" id="post-content-4798275">
									

<p>Riemann hit on the main issue. I brought up 5001 mainly because it accurately represents a threat's power without detracting from it. The buildup in that is fast-paced and stakes rise in a way that makes the use of the HECOR weapon a last resort. Perhaps that was the wrong bit of advice and I apologize for that.</p>
<p>I'm not really seeing much improvement on the focus side. Now, this is no longer just a wormhole but also a cell-like structure that wants to eat the earth. I can see you want to make this a formidable threat. The problem is that you seem to be bouncing up and down with new ideas without correcting the other problems. You need to slow down.</p>
<p>Please concentrate on correcting your focus issues and make your anomaly a bit more consistent.</p>

							</div>

								
